{"id":"e343870c773cb68e","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-computable.md","title":"部分可计算与全可计算函数","display":"df-computable — 部分可计算与全可计算函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-computable","aliases":["20-df-computable"],"display":"df-computable — 部分可计算与全可计算函数","chapter":"1","section":"1.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 1.5.1；Notation: Partial Computable Functions","source_pdf_pages":[46],"source_printed_pages":[10],"depends_on":["[[20-df-tmcomp]]","[[20-df-partial-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-computable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-computable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computable — 部分可计算与全可计算函数"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 1.5.1；Notation: Partial Computable Functions"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>46</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>10</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04aa1148d91b88f8\" href=\"?note=04aa1148d91b88f8\" title=\"20-df-tmcomp\">20-df-tmcomp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega\">\\(f:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(\\vec x)\">\\(M(\\vec x)\\)</span> 使用固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元输入约定。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"04aa1148d91b88f8\" href=\"?note=04aa1148d91b88f8\" title=\"20-df-tmcomp\">20-df-tmcomp</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(\\vec x)\">\\(M(\\vec x)\\)</span> 精确采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"04aa1148d91b88f8\" href=\"?note=04aa1148d91b88f8\" title=\"20-df-tmcomp\">20-df-tmcomp</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_0^{(k)}(\\vec x)\">\\(c_0^{(k)}(\\vec x)\\)</span> 与停止输出关系；不另选元组输入编码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathcal C_k:=\\{f:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega:\\exists M\\in\\mathcal M\\ \\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\ [f(\\vec x)\\simeq M(\\vec x)]\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}:=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathcal C_k:=\\{f:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega:\\exists M\\in\\mathcal M\\ \\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\ [f(\\vec x)\\simeq M(\\vec x)]\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}:=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k\">\\(\\mathcal C_k\\)</span> 是部分可计算函数族；本书不带“partial”的 computable function 默认全函数。发散输入必须由机器不给出正常停止输出来实现，不能把拒绝状态当成额外输出。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 1.5.1；Notation: Partial Computable Functions；印刷页 10；PDF 第 46 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-tmcomp","status":"resolved","id":"04aa1148d91b88f8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tmcomp]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tmcomp","status":"resolved","id":"04aa1148d91b88f8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tmcomp","status":"resolved","id":"04aa1148d91b88f8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M(\\vec x)$ 精确采用 [[20-df-tmcomp]] 的 $c_0^{(k)}(\\vec x)$ 与停止输出关系；不另选元组输入编码。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"M(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{tot}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"M(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"c_0^{(k)}(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}computable}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathcal C_k:=\\{f:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega:\\exists M\\in\\mathcal M\\ \\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\ [f(\\vec x)\\simeq M(\\vec x)]\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}:=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k","display":false}],"bytes":1702,"backlinks":[{"id":"1a1973e9b4398b95","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"c21e5e4663b12909","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"832f53dc90c8947a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"4a668d5b21b39c67","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。"},{"id":"24856bb9ed3c13f4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"d12aec25b5426f2f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-truth-table]]；see [[20-df-mred]]。"},{"id":"ea4f6c0d21b23194","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"2d6dc64668d77215","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"ecb9f43e837dcf35","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tree]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"1425fc4773bfa69c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count"